[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5990389589","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124164#issuecomment-5990389589","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124164","id":5990389589,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZQ4XVQ","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T07:54:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T07:59:57Z","body":"Woh :exploding_head: this fix looks correct, but slightly worrying is the state they had been in before.\r\n\r\nIt's a bug fix, but it we should note it will be expected to change behaviour (even so slightly). I'll try and run this with some games with Godot physics to see if I can detect any obvious differences.\r\n\r\n(Although this is `Godot physics` only, and it should be noted that `Bullet` is the default, for 3D at least).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5990389589/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5990533037","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124164#issuecomment-5990533037","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124164","id":5990533037,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZRBHrQ","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T08:05:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T08:05:33Z","body":"Ok let's try this out in the next 3.7 dev build.\r\n\r\nIt's merged in 4.x already (although for 2D only) but the principle is the same in 3D.\r\nAs usual, if we get any problems we can always revert / add a backward compat option.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5990533037/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5991740502","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124164#issuecomment-5991740502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124164","id":5991740502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZSK0Vg","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T09:27:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T09:27:51Z","body":"My expectation is that the only possible behaviour change is the higher performance. This fix is truly a gift (if I am not mistaken).\r\n\r\nThe huge list of extra BVH pairs produced due to _update_shapes_with_motion() will all be discarded during narrow phase testing because the narrow phase will only be testing the shape at the current transform  (unless CCD is also enabled), even though broadphase tested the motion swept shape. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5991740502/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5991969654","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124164#issuecomment-5991969654","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124164","id":5991969654,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZSYzdg","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T09:42:49Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T12:51:52Z","body":"Actually, yes, there is a slight change, because of the larger pair list. All those non-colliding pairs would be woken up under current logic, whereas when the pairs are not there, the wake lists will be smaller. So yeah, slight changes, you are correct. There might be other small logic changes based on the old different pair lists.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5991969654/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5992027363","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124164#issuecomm